I have a Sun 4/110 running 4.0.3, and I have the latest patchlevel of NH
(level 6).  It often crashes with just a Memory Fault.  Unfortunately this
usually happens in the middle of a long game.  It just happened tonight
when moving from Level 24 to Level 25.  (I was playing as Wizard, so I
saved my save file.)  When it occurs, I just get the error message, and
the game abruptly ends.  This sucks.

Anyway, this has been happening to me on Suns since the much earlier days
of NH.  Seems to me that there is no way to capture additional information
about such a problem.  I will be glad to supply any information that the
development wants, but I can't see where I will get it from.
